[center]{{image:logo}}
[size=3]Macro suite, planner overlay, stash presets, session stats, map mods and more.[/size]
[size=2][color=#8e96a4]Version {{version}} · a [url=https://github.com/LavaGang/MelonLoader]MelonLoader[/url] mod · tested on Last Epoch {{game_version}}[/color][/size]

[b][color=#ee5396]Using mods online is against Last Epoch's terms of service.[/color][/b]
[/center]
[line]
[size=5][b][color=#5ba8a4]Macros[/color][/b][/size]
Highly configurable macro editor with various condition rules.
[list]
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Skill Slots[/color][/b]: [font=Courier New]Left Ctrl[/font] + skill key toggles a slot. Per-slot conditions, plus [b]Shared Conditions[/b] (e.g. enemy gate) for all.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Macros[/color][/b]: sets per class or all classes. Start alone, on key press, while held or on toggle; steps cast, drink, town portal, wait, wait until, message.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Targets[/color][/b]: cursor, nearest, rarest, weakest or pack centre, limited by range, rarity, mod, ailment.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Conditions[/color][/b]: health, mana, ward, buffs, skills, potions, enemies (health, rarity, mods, ailments), zone and more; all of, any of, none of, optional hold time.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Sharing[/color][/b]: [b]Copy share code[/b] and [b]Import set[/b].
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Potions[/color][/b]: ready-made Auto potion for low health or a full potion's missing heal.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Debugging[/color][/b]: footer switches show macro state, enemy ranges and targets, plus a notice per trigger.
[/list]
{{media:macro-editor}}
{{media:shared-target}}
[line]
[size=5][b][color=#5ba8a4]Planner[/color][/b][/size]
Imported build marked across interfaces, with a built-in guide viewer.
[list]
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Import[/color][/b]: Maxroll export, Last Epoch Tools link or build data, pasted on Planner tab; builds kept in a library.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Marks[/color][/b]: outlines by state (matches, partial, to place, not in build); next point labelled; hover hints.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Gear[/color][/b]: badge on each planned equipment slot and idol, coloured ring on idol altar and blessing slots, outline on weaver tree item sockets; hover shows planned item as game's own tooltip beside equipped one, with a card listing planned affixes and tiers.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Compare with build[/color][/b]: optional hotkey shows planned item for hovered item's slot.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Variants[/color][/b]: one build and variant per character (levelling, endgame and so on), each with its planned level; changed only with ◀ and ▶, hint once next variant's level is reached; Last Epoch Tools variant links gathered into one build, each with own gear and link.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Checklist[/color][/b]: done out of planned per tree, skill bar, gear, idols, blessings, weaver tree and weaver items, with next steps per tree; hover a gear row for planned item.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Guide[/color][/b]: Maxroll build's own guide in game, per variant, with game icons for skills, passives and items; hover a name for its game tooltip; menu search finds its text; Last Epoch Tools builds open their guide page, set by guide link when build data names none.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Loot filter[/color][/b]: game loot filter made based on the planner, for one setup or levelling to endgame in one filter: planner uniques, slot and legendary rules, crafting and shatter rules, rest hidden; strictness Levelling to Very strict; active only on Use now.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Drawing only[/color][/b]: nothing spent, chosen, equipped or moved; files written only for build library and on loot filter Make; on by default.
[/list]
{{media:planner-passives}}
{{media:planner-skills}}
{{media:planner-weaver}}
{{media:planner-blessings}}
{{media:planner-tab}}
{{media:planner-checklist}}
{{media:planner-guide}}
{{media:planner-guide-tips}}
{{media:planner-filter}}
{{media:planner-filter-rules}}
[line]
[size=5][b][color=#5ba8a4]Stash[/color][/b][/size]
Create or use stash tab presets and easily apply them.
[list]
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Preset[/color][/b]: Epoch Assist layout: overflow, class idols and gear, idols by size, legendaries, exalted by slot, uniques by LP, sets, altars, corrupted; build uniques from Planner library.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Budget[/color][/b]: slider or typed amount; most useful tabs first; merged tabs stand in for groups until budget covers them all.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Own tabs[/color][/b]: Keep or Reuse each folder and tab; Fit items adds tabs for items already stored.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Apply[/color][/b]: one step at a time, or all after summary of changes and gold; step count known up front.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Items in wrong tab[/color][/b]: count per tab, outlines in stash window, target tab on hover. Items never moved.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Edit[/color][/b]: copy preset, drag folders and tabs, rename, recolour, remove with cost shown first, undo; save stash as preset.
[/list]
{{media:stash-page}}
{{media:stash-apply}}
[line]
[size=5][b][color=#5ba8a4]Session[/color][/b][/size]
Dashboard of each game session statistics.
[list]
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Focus[/color][/b]: chosen figures as tiles and charts: favour, reputation, memory amber, echoes, level, drops, XP, gold, deaths.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Live[/color][/b]: per-hour and last 10 minutes rates, time in and out of town, level progress, time to next level and faction rank.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Charts[/color][/b]: figure over session, timeline of zones, rare drops and deaths, drops by rarity, time by zone.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Tables[/color][/b]: factions with rank progress; echoes with clear time, gains, modifier, reward, corruption; deaths, monolith picks, loot filter drops.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Past sessions[/color][/b]: filter by character and range, per-hour trend, best marks, same dashboard per session; leave out of trends or delete.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]New session[/color][/b]: ends session and starts next in place, for timed splits.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]History[/color][/b]: kept in [font=Courier New]UserData/EpochAssist/sessions/[/font] within set limits, off in Config › Sessions › History; Export CSV writes two spreadsheet files. Nothing sent anywhere.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Mini HUD[/color][/b]: figures beside status pill as card, tiles or line in pill: session time, level, XP, gold, drops, echoes, favour, reputation, memory amber, deaths, each as total, per hour or both. Pace graphs, game colours, text and card size, labels on or off; hover for larger graph, three rates and breakdown.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Colours[/color][/b]: own colour per figure in Config › Sessions, game's by default; dashboard uses same.
[/list]
{{media:session-dashboard}}
{{media:session-tables}}
{{media:session-past}}
{{media:session-hud}}
{{media:session-hud-detail}}
{{media:settings-session-hud}}
[line]
[size=5][b][color=#5ba8a4]Map Reveal[/color][/b][/size]
Reveal entire map on overlay and minimap. Customize map appearance.
[list]
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Icons[/color][/b]: shrines, rune prisons, caches, tomb chests, omen windows and more, shown on zone entry.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Zoom[/color][/b]: overlay zooms past game's widest; separate corner minimap zoom.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Look[/color][/b]: Slate, Clear or game style, thicker outline.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Player marker[/color][/b]: any game icon, rotated, tinted, scaled, offset.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Drawing only[/color][/b]: explored map and game settings untouched.
[/list]
{{media:map-overlay}}
{{media:map-look}}
{{media:map-icons}}
[line]
[size=5][b][color=#5ba8a4]Proximity Interact[/color][/b][/size]
Automatically interact with objects as they come into range.
[list]
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Use[/color][/b]: shrines, chests, caches, rune prisons, forges, unstable rifts, blood crystals.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Pick up[/color][/b]: keys, crafting materials, loot filter picks.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]In reach[/color][/b]: never moves the character or reaches past game range.
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Options[/color][/b]: hold key, mini HUD count, per-use notice, reach rings.
[/list]
{{media:interact}}
[line]
[size=5][b][color=#5ba8a4]Config[/color][/b][/size]
Highly configurable settings available via the Config tab. General options:
[list]
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Mini HUD[/color][/b]: each feature's state and session figures while menu is closed, in order dragged to; click for quick toggles. Notifications: own position, duration, count, kinds and order.
{{media:hud}}
{{media:settings-hud}}
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Appearance[/color][/b]: themes (Carbonfox, Slate, Ember, Epoch, Glass), fonts, animations. [b]Colour vision[/b]: rarity and danger colours kept apart for deuteranopia, protanopia, tritanopia in mod overlays.
{{media:appearance}}
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Diagnostics[/color][/b]: [b]Copy diagnostics[/b] copies mod state for bug reports, without names or paths. [b]Mods[/b] lists other loaded mods and shared patch targets. Nothing sent anywhere.
{{media:diagnostics}}
[*][b][color=#25be6a]Profiles[/color][/b]: one setup per character; export and import to share.
{{media:profiles}}
[/list]
[line]
[size=5][b][color=#5ba8a4]Install[/color][/b][/size]
[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://github.com/LavaGang/MelonLoader/releases/latest]latest MelonLoader[/url] into game folder; start game once.
[*]Extract zip into Last Epoch folder (next to [font=Courier New]Last Epoch.exe[/font]).
[*]In game, [b]F2[/b] opens menu.
[/list]
All data saved in [font=Courier New]UserData/EpochAssist/[/font] in game folder.
[line]
[size=5][b][color=#5ba8a4]Bug reports[/color][/b][/size]
[b]Config › General › Diagnostics › Copy diagnostics[/b], then paste into an [url=https://github.com/wistb/EpochAssist/issues]issue on GitHub[/url]. Crash reports: [font=Courier New]UserData/EpochAssist/reports/[/font].
Source and build [url=https://github.com/wistb/EpochAssist]on GitHub[/url] (GPL-3.0).
